  "details": "Now that the Security Update is on the horizon, please consider adding a slider to adjust microphone sensitivity in the future. Currently, the only way to have one is with a modded client.\nIn my use, having access to a means to disable the built-in microphone gate allowed me to play music/audio through my mic at a reasonable, quiet volume. Without mods, you have to crank up the volume to make sure the gate doesn't think some of the audio is background noise before it cuts it out completely.",
